					{
						"sceneId": 3,
						"position": [
							-1636.396,
							12.796,
							9718.427
						],
						"pointId": 9677
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 150290401,
					"content": "Ah, you did it? Your investigation into the Battle of Seven Colors must have been fruitful indeed. I do hope you share what you learned.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150290402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Biram"
				},
				{
					"id": 150290402,
					"content": "Wow, the scroll is finished already!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150290403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Caholom"
				},
				{
					"id": 150290403,
					"content": "Elder Tlapo's wisdom is never wrong!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150290404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Aywastin"
				},
				{
					"id": 150290404,
					"content": "#Yeah, we should explain... Take it away, {NICKNAME}!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150290405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150290405,
					"content": "You share everything you learned about the special color while keeping Citlali's contribution a secret.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150290406
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150290406,
					"content": "I see...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150290407
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Biram"
				},
				{
					"id": 150290407,
					"content": "You don't look surprised at all...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150290408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150290408,
					"content": "It makes perfect sense! History is the memory of a people. If we want to depict it, a dye derived from people's memories is, of course, the best choice.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150290409
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Biram"
				},
				{
					"id": 150290409,
					"content": "Now, it's just a matter of preserving this secret technique...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150290410
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Biram"
				},
				{
					"id": 150290410,
					"content": "Hmm... From your description, it sounds like learning the technique requires the previous holder to share their memories?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150290411
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Biram"
				},
				{
					"id": 150290411,
					"content": "Well, yeah...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150290412
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150290412,
					"content": "In that case, I must work with our priests to re-invent the technique based on the principles you described.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150290413
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Biram"
				},
				{
					"id": 150290413,
					"content": "#After all, memories are precious things — meant to be shared with those closest to us. I cannot take that choice away from you, {NICKNAME}.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150290414
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Biram"
				},
				{
					"id": 150290414,
					"content": "You completed your task admirably. Finding a way to carry on that legacy is now our duty.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150290415
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Biram"
				},
				{
					"id": 150290415,
					"content": "Alright! We'll leave that to you!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150290416
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150290416,
					"content": "Oh, and please pass along my thanks to Granny Itztli.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150290417
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Biram"
				},
				{
					"id": 150290417,
					"content": "We interrogated the Fontainian merchant she apprehended, and it turns out, he is the reason some among our tribe started to question our history.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150290418
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Biram"
				},
				{
					"id": 150290418,
					"content": "He hired people to spread misinformation about the Battle of Seven Colors. The recent friction within the tribe is entirely his doing.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150290419
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Biram"
				},
				{
					"id": 150290419,
					"content": "We now have a record of his crimes and will begin working with Fontaine authorities in a few days.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150290420
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Biram"
				},
				{
					"id": 150290420,
					"content": "So, he was behind the controversy in the first place! Guess it's easier to investigate when people are already questioning something...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150290421
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150290421,
					"content": "Anyway, that clears it up! People don't just question their history out of nowhere.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150290422
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150290422,
					"content": "Thank you, Biram. We'll be on our way.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150290423
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150290423,
					"content": "Until we meet again.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Biram"
				}
			]
		},
		{
